---
---
<!-- Header -->
<div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">
  <div class="cyber-section-header">
    <span class="cyber-section-tag">MY EXPERTISE</span>
    <h2 class="cyber-section-title">MMT <em>天賦系統</em></h2>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="about" class="mmt-cyber section">
  <!-- Corner Ornament -->
  <div class="corner-ornament corner-ornament--tl" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="co-ring co-ring-1"></div>
    <div class="co-ring co-ring-2"></div>
    <div class="co-ring co-ring-3"></div>
    <div class="co-dot"></div>
    <div class="co-cross-h"></div>
    <div class="co-cross-v"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="corner-ornament corner-ornament--br" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="co-ring co-ring-1"></div>
    <div class="co-ring co-ring-2"></div>
    <div class="co-dot"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Aurora -->
  <div class="aurora-overlay">
    <div class="aurora-1"></div>
    <div class="aurora-3"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- Particles -->
  <div class="magic-particles" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="mp" style="top:10%;right:4%;--sz:0.85rem;--d:9s;--dl:-1s;--op:0.42;">✦</span>
    <span class="mp" style="bottom:15%;left:3%;--sz:0.7rem;--d:11s;--dl:-4s;--op:0.38;">✧</span>
    <span class="mp" style="top:55%;right:12%;--sz:0.6rem;--d:8s;--dl:-6s;--op:0.30;">✸</span>
    <span class="mp" style="top:30%;left:6%;--sz:0.5rem;--d:13s;--dl:-2s;--op:0.28;">✺</span>
    <span class="mp" style="bottom:30%;right:20%;--sz:0.75rem;--d:10s;--dl:-5s;--op:0.34;">✦</span>
    <span class="mp" style="top:75%;left:20%;--sz:0.6rem;--d:12s;--dl:-8s;--op:0.30;">✧</span>
    <span class="mp" style="top:20%;right:30%;--sz:0.55rem;--d:14s;--dl:-3s;--op:0.26;">✸</span>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:2;" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
    <div class="row mb-5 align-items-center">

      <!-- Left: text -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 pe-lg-5" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="120">
        <span class="mmt-cyber-eyebrow">WHAT IS MMT</span>
        <h3 class="mmt-cyber-title">甚麼是 MMT 天賦系統？</h3>
        <p class="mmt-cyber-body">
          MMT 是一套結合<strong style="color:#deb887;">數字排序、心理學與關係圓形圖譜</strong>的人際系統科技。
          透過專利演算法，只需輸入你的<strong style="color:#deb887;">出生年月日</strong>，
          即可運算出 22 種人格特質，建構出專屬的「關係設計圖」。
        </p>

        <ul class="mmt-ability-list">
          <li>看懂你在關係裡的行為邏輯與盲點</li>
          <li>提升團隊合作與領導力</li>
          <li>修復親密關係、強化親子理解</li>
          <li>精準掌握人與人之間的默契與衝突動力</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="mmt-cyber-stats">
          <div class="mmt-cyber-stat">
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-num">
              <span data-purecounter-start="0" data-purecounter-end="5" data-purecounter-duration="1" class="purecounter"></span>+
            </span>
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-label">探索年資</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mmt-cyber-stat">
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-num">
              <span data-purecounter-start="0" data-purecounter-end="300" data-purecounter-duration="1" class="purecounter"></span>+
            </span>
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-label">陪跑個案</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mmt-cyber-stat">
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-num">
              <span data-purecounter-start="0" data-purecounter-end="50" data-purecounter-duration="1" class="purecounter"></span>+
            </span>
            <span class="mmt-cyber-stat-label">講座 / 分析</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Signature -->
        <div class="mmt-cyber-sig">
          <img src="/img/misc/signature-1.webp" alt="LuLu 簽名" width="96" />
          <div>
            <p class="mmt-cyber-sig-name">LuLu 邱議萱</p>
            <p class="mmt-cyber-sig-role">MMT 人際探索分析師｜保險顧問</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: image stack -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 mt-5 mt-lg-0" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="180">
        <div class="image-stack">
          <div class="image-stack-item image-stack-item-top" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="260">
            <img src="/img/mmt/mmt6.png" alt="MMT" class="img-fluid rounded-2 shadow-lg" style="filter:sepia(12%) saturate(80%);" />
          </div>
          <div class="image-stack-item image-stack-item-bottom" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="340">
            <img src="/img/mmt/mmt19.png" alt="MMT" class="img-fluid rounded-2 shadow-lg" style="filter:sepia(12%) saturate(80%);" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Value cards -->
    <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="value-cyber-card">
          <div class="card-shimmer"></div>
          <div class="cyber-card-icon"><i class="bi bi-compass"></i></div>
          <h3>Our Mission｜使命</h3>
          <p>透過 MMT 系統與心理學的結合，幫助每個人認識自我、發掘潛能，讓理解自己與他人不再是難題。建立清晰、自在、有方向的溝通橋樑。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="value-cyber-card">
          <div class="card-shimmer"></div>
          <div class="cyber-card-icon"><i class="bi bi-binoculars"></i></div>
          <h3>Our Vision｜願景</h3>
          <p>相信每個人都值得擁有清楚自我定位與人生方向的能力。透過 MMT 的結構化模型，協助人們跨越關係卡點，成為找到生涯道路的明燈。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div class="value-cyber-card">
          <div class="card-shimmer"></div>
          <div class="cyber-card-icon"><i class="bi bi-heart"></i></div>
          <h3>Our Values｜價值觀</h3>
          <p>理解是改變的起點。以同理心傾聽與陪伴每一位探索者。結合心理學理論與象徵語言，科學與直覺並進，引導出專屬的發展方向。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
